    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d67">

                <pb facs="0139" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg117"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–851: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in the
                        United Kingdom </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-08T14:30:00-05:00">December 8,
                            1951—2:30 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2844. For Gifford. Pls advise whether you raised with Eden Dec 5 problem election
                    Greece vs Byelorussia to SC and if so results. (Delga 567 rptd info London 905.)
                    If not done, sugg approach be made if you believe might be helpful.</p>
                <p>To assist Dept in deciding on approach other Eur cos pls advise by Mon p m<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d67-f1"/> if possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d67-f1" n="1" xml:id="d67-f1-content">
